{"group":"Agent","documents":{"/notes/Agent/⌚️如何与-Agent-协作编程":{"path":"/notes/Agent/⌚️如何与-Agent-协作编程","html":"<h1>⌚️如何与 Agent 协作编程</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Last Format Time：9/16/2026 19:24:50</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>我负责定义问题、架构、边界和验收标准，Agent 负责调查、实现、验证和重复劳动。</p>\n<p>可以把 Agent 理解成：执行能力很强，但需要明确技术方向的工程师。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"推荐协作流程\" tabindex=\"-1\">推荐协作流程</h2>\n<p>完整流程：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>需求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Explore（探索代码库）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Plan（提出方案）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Decide（人工决策）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Implement（Agent 实现）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Verify（验证）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Review（人工 Review）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Iterate（继续修改）</span></span></code></pre><p>其中：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>人：What + Why + Tradeoff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Agent：大量 How</span></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"不要直接让-agent-写代码\" tabindex=\"-1\">不要直接让 Agent 写代码</h2>\n<p>不推荐：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>给用户列表增加搜索功能。</span></span></code></pre><p>推荐 Repository Exploration（代码库探索）：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>先不要修改代码。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>请分析用户列表相关实现，找到：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. 数据从哪里获取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 分页在哪里实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 筛选条件如何保存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 项目中有没有类似实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>然后告诉我：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 涉及哪些文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 当前数据流</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 推荐实现方案</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 潜在风险</span></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"先-plan再-implement\" tabindex=\"-1\">先 Plan，再 Implement</h2>\n<p>推荐：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>先分析当前实现，不要修改代码。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>告诉我：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. 当前架构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 需要修改的位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 推荐方案</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 方案的 tradeoff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>5. 潜在风险</span></span></code></pre><p>等方案确定后可以先判断Agent 到底有没有理解当前架构：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>按照这个方案实现。</span></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"任务一定要可验收\" tabindex=\"-1\">任务一定要可验收</h2>\n<p>不好的任务：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>优化一下这个组件。</span></span></code></pre><p>问题：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>“优化”没有明确标准。</span></span></code></pre><p>推荐：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>优化 UserTable。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>目标：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. page 切换时 Header 不重新 render</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. Row 数据没变化时 Row 不重新 render</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 不改变现有 API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 不引入新的状态管理库</span></span></code></pre><p>再增加 Definition of Done（完成标准）：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>- lint 通过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- typecheck 通过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 原测试通过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 新功能有测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- public API 不变</span></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"一次只解决一个逻辑闭环\" tabindex=\"-1\">一次只解决一个逻辑闭环</h2>\n<p>不推荐：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>帮我优化整个后台：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 性能</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 权限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- SEO</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 测试</span></span></code></pre><p>应该拆成：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Task 1：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>找到 UserTable 不必要 render 的原因</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Task 2：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>修复 render propagation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Task 3：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>添加测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Task 4：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Review 当前实现</span></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"控制修改范围\" tabindex=\"-1\">控制修改范围</h2>\n<p>Agent 容易出现：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>发现 A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>修改 A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>顺便修改 B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>顺便重构 C</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>顺便更新 D</span></span></code></pre><p>最后：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>27 files changed</span></span></code></pre><p>因此需要明确Scope Control（范围控制）例如：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>修改范围限制在：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>src/components/tabs/**</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>src/hooks/useControllableState.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>不要修改其他模块。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>如果确实需要修改其他模块，</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>先说明原因。</span></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"适合-agent-的任务\" tabindex=\"-1\">适合 Agent 的任务</h2>\n<h3 id=\"重复性机械性任务\" tabindex=\"-1\">重复性、机械性任务</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>补测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>补 TypeScript 类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>rename</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>批量 refactor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>API migration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lint 修复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>补 loading/error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>更新文档</span></span></code></pre><p>这类任务特点：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>规则清楚</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>重复劳动多</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>容易验证</span></span></code></pre><h3 id=\"人设计agent-实现\" tabindex=\"-1\">人设计，Agent 实现</h3>\n<p>例如：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>组件 API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>状态管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>缓存策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>权限模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>数据库 Schema</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>状态边界</span></span></code></pre><p>推荐：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>人：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>设计 architecture</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Agent：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>按照 architecture 实现</span></span></code></pre><p>例如：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Tabs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Root</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── List</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Trigger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── Content</span></span></code></pre><p>架构由人确定，然后 Agent 实现：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Controlled / Uncontrolled</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Roving Tabindex</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Manual Activation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ARIA</span></span></code></pre><h3 id=\"agent-调查人做决定\" tabindex=\"-1\">Agent 调查，人做决定</h3>\n<p>特别适合 Debug：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>为什么页面越来越慢？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>为什么 hydration mismatch？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>为什么接口请求两次？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>为什么 build 变慢？</span></span></code></pre><p>可以让 Agent：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>先调查，不修改。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>告诉我：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. root cause</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 调用链</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 可能方案</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 每种方案 tradeoff</span></span></code></pre><p>然后由人选择方案。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"agent-写完不等于完成\" tabindex=\"-1\">Agent 写完不等于完成</h2>\n<p>错误：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Implement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Done</span></span></code></pre><p>正确：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Implement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>typecheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>review diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Done</span></span></code></pre><p>因此可以固定要求：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>实现完成后：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. 运行 lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 运行 typecheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 运行相关测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 修复发现的问题</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>5. review 当前 git diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>最后告诉我：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 修改了什么</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 为什么这么修改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 验证结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 剩余风险</span></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"让-agent-review-agent\" tabindex=\"-1\">让 Agent Review Agent</h2>\n<p>实现完成后可以重新切换角色：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>现在不要修改代码。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>假设你是另一个 Senior Engineer。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Review 当前 git diff。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>重点检查：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. correctness</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. backward compatibility</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 是否过度修改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 重复逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>5. 潜在 bug</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>6. 是否存在更简单方案</span></span></code></pre><p>形成：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Agent A：Implement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Agent B：Review</span></span></code></pre><p>即使实际上是同一个 Agent，也能减少很多问题。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"通用-agent-prompt-模板\" tabindex=\"-1\">通用 Agent Prompt 模板</h2>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>目标：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;我要实现什么></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>背景：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;业务 / 架构背景></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>要求：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- xxx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- xxx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- xxx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>限制：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 不修改 xxx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 不引入 xxx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 保持 xxx API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第一步：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>先阅读相关代码，不要修改。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>告诉我：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. 当前实现方式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 涉及文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 数据流 / 调用链</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 推荐方案</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>5. 风险</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>方案明确后再实现。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>实现完成后：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- typecheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- review diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>最后总结：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 修改内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 关键设计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 验证结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 剩余风险</span></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"能力不能完全外包给-agent\" tabindex=\"-1\">能力不能完全外包给 Agent</h2>\n<p>以后 Agent 写代码会越来越强，但工程师依然需要掌握：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>需求拆解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>架构设计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>状态所有权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>数据流设计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>API 设计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Tradeoff 判断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Code Review</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Debug Reasoning</span></span></code></pre><p>因为 Agent 可以很快写：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"js\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">useEffect</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">...</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">useMemo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">...</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">useCallback</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">...</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">)</span></span></code></pre><p>但人需要判断：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>这个 state 是否本来就不应该存在？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>这个 Effect 是否在同步两个 source of truth？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>这个 Context 边界设计是否合理？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>这个 abstraction 是否过度设计？</span></span></code></pre><p>所以未来工程师的价值会从：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>我能不能写出这 100 行代码</span></span></code></pre><p>逐渐变成：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>我能不能判断这 100 行代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>是否应该存在。</span></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"最终心智模型\" tabindex=\"-1\">最终心智模型</h2>\n<p>以后使用 Codex、Claude Code、Cursor Agent 等工具时，可以固定记住：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>① Explore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>理解代码库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>② Plan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>提出方案</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>③ Decide</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>人工决定架构和 tradeoff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>④ Implement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Agent 实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>⑤ Verify</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lint / typecheck / test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>⑥ Review</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>人工 Review diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>⑦ Iterate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>继续修改</span></span></code></pre><p>不要训练“怎么让 Agent 一次把代码写对”，而应该训练“怎么把模糊需求==拆==成 Agent 可以可靠==执行==、==验证==和 Review 的工程任务”。</p>\n","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"推荐协作流程","text":"推荐协作流程"},{"depth":2,"id":"不要直接让-agent-写代码","text":"不要直接让 Agent 写代码"},{"depth":2,"id":"先-plan再-implement","text":"先 Plan，再 Implement"},{"depth":2,"id":"任务一定要可验收","text":"任务一定要可验收"},{"depth":2,"id":"一次只解决一个逻辑闭环","text":"一次只解决一个逻辑闭环"},{"depth":2,"id":"控制修改范围","text":"控制修改范围"},{"depth":2,"id":"适合-agent-的任务","text":"适合 Agent 的任务"},{"depth":3,"id":"重复性机械性任务","text":"重复性、机械性任务"},{"depth":3,"id":"人设计agent-实现","text":"人设计，Agent 实现"},{"depth":3,"id":"agent-调查人做决定","text":"Agent 调查，人做决定"},{"depth":2,"id":"agent-写完不等于完成","text":"Agent 写完不等于完成"},{"depth":2,"id":"让-agent-review-agent","text":"让 Agent Review Agent"},{"depth":2,"id":"通用-agent-prompt-模板","text":"通用 Agent Prompt 模板"},{"depth":2,"id":"能力不能完全外包给-agent","text":"能力不能完全外包给 Agent"},{"depth":2,"id":"最终心智模型","text":"最终心智模型"}],"highlighted":{}},"/notes/Agent/⌚️Spec-Coding（规格驱动开发）":{"path":"/notes/Agent/⌚️Spec-Coding（规格驱动开发）","html":"<h1>⌚️Spec Coding（规格驱动开发）</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Last Format Time：9/16/2026 19:24:50</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Spec Coding = 先定义规格，再实现代码。不要直接告诉 Agent“帮我实现这个功能”，而是先明确这个功能应该满足什么要求，再让 Agent 按规格实现。</p>\n<p>基本流程：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Requirement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Spec</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Plan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Tasks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Implementation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Verification</span></span></code></pre><p>它和普通 Vibe Coding 最大的区别在于：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Vibe Coding：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>需求 → 直接写代码 → 边写边改 → 最后不知道什么算完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Spec Coding：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>需求 → 明确完成标准 → 实现 → 对照标准验收</span></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"spec-的作用\" tabindex=\"-1\">Spec 的作用</h2>\n<p>Spec 本质上可以理解为：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>这个功能要做什么？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>应该有什么行为？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>边界情况是什么？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>不能做什么？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>什么状态下算完成？</span></span></code></pre><p>例如实现搜索功能：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"md\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Goal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">用户可以通过用户名搜索用户。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Behavior</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">1.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> 输入为空时不请求。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">2.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> 停止输入 300ms 后搜索。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">3.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> 请求中显示 loading。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">4.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> 无结果显示 Empty State。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">5.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> 请求失败显示 Error State。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">6.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> 新请求结果不能被旧请求覆盖。</span></span></code></pre><p>重点：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Spec 尽量描述 What，而不是 How。</span></span></code></pre><p>例如：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ 使用 useEffect 实现 debounce</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ 用户停止输入 300ms 后发送搜索请求</span></span></code></pre><p>前者规定了实现方式，后者规定了系统行为。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"一个-spec-应该包含什么\" tabindex=\"-1\">一个 Spec 应该包含什么</h2>\n<p>推荐结构：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"md\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># Feature Name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Goal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">这个功能解决什么问题？</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## User Story</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">As a ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">I want ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">So that ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Requirements</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> 功能要求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> 功能要求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Behavior</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Normal Flow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">正常流程。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Edge Cases</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">边界情况。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Constraints</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> 技术栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> 性能要求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> 兼容性要求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> 不允许修改的内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Acceptance Criteria</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">Given ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">When ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">Then ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Non-goals</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">本次明确不做：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Open Questions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">尚未确认的问题。</span></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"acceptance-criteria验收标准\" tabindex=\"-1\">Acceptance Criteria（验收标准）</h2>\n<p>常见写法：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Given ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>When ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Then ...</span></span></code></pre><p>例如：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Given 输入框为空</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>When 页面加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Then 不应该发送搜索请求</span></span></code></pre><p>或者：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Given 用户输入 \"dan\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>When 300ms 内没有继续输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Then 应该发送一次搜索请求</span></span></code></pre><p>Acceptance Criteria 后面可以直接转成测试。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"spec-和-test-的关系\" tabindex=\"-1\">Spec 和 Test 的关系</h2>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Spec = 系统应该是什么样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Test = 验证系统是不是这样</span></span></code></pre><p>关系可以理解为：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Requirement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Spec</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Acceptance Criteria</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Implementation</span></span></code></pre><p>例如 Spec：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入为空时不发送请求</span></span></code></pre><p>测试：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"ts\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">it</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">'does not request when query is empty'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, () </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">  // ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">})</span></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"plan-和-spec-的区别\" tabindex=\"-1\">Plan 和 Spec 的区别</h2>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Spec</span></span></code></pre><p>回答：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>做什么？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>例如：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>搜索输入停止 300ms 后发送请求。</span></span></code></pre><p>而：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Plan</span></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"最后进行-spec-verification\" tabindex=\"-1\">最后进行 Spec Verification</h2>\n<p>实现完成后，不应该只问：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>写完了吗？</span></span></code></pre><p>而应该让 Agent：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>对照最初的 Spec 检查实现。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>对每条 Acceptance Criteria 标记：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PASS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FAIL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PARTIAL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>并给出对应证据：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 函数 / 组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 测试</span></span></code></pre><p>例如：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1. 空输入不发送请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PASS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 300ms debounce</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PASS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. Loading State</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PASS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. Error State</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PASS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>5. 旧请求不能覆盖新请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PARTIAL</span></span></code></pre><p>这样才能真正判断需求是否完成。</p>\n","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"spec-的作用","text":"Spec 的作用"},{"depth":2,"id":"一个-spec-应该包含什么","text":"一个 Spec 应该包含什么"},{"depth":2,"id":"acceptance-criteria验收标准","text":"Acceptance Criteria（验收标准）"},{"depth":2,"id":"spec-和-test-的关系","text":"Spec 和 Test 的关系"},{"depth":2,"id":"plan-和-spec-的区别","text":"Plan 和 Spec 的区别"},{"depth":2,"id":"最后进行-spec-verification","text":"最后进行 Spec Verification"}],"highlighted":{}},"/notes/Agent/ClaudeCode-CLI-的基本用法":{"path":"/notes/Agent/ClaudeCode-CLI-的基本用法","html":"<h1>ClaudeCode CLI 的基本用法</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Last Format Time：9/16/2026 19:24:50</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV14rzQB9EJj/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=47c9acd507be61251cd2bb730416395c\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV14rzQB9EJj/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=47c9acd507be61251cd2bb730416395c</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"控制台\" tabindex=\"-1\">控制台</h2>\n<p>常见的控制台命令：</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">mkdir</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 文件名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">cd</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">cd</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> ..</span></span></code></pre><p>alt + 回车用于换行</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">claude</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> --dangerously-skip-permissions</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">/rewind</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 回滚代码（按两下esc也可以实现）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">/resume</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 找到之前的对话</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"上下文\" tabindex=\"-1\">上下文</h2>\n<pre data-lang=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">/compact</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 压缩需求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">/clear</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">   全部清空</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">/init</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">    创建文档</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">/memory</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">  打开对应的CLAUDE.md文档</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre><h3 id=\"hook\" tabindex=\"-1\">hook</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">/hooks</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">  打开hook配置页面</span></span></code></pre><h3 id=\"hook-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">hook</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">/hooks</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">  打开hook配置页面</span></span></code></pre><h3 id=\"skills\" tabindex=\"-1\">skills</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">/技能明</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> 对应的提示词（会自己调用，不需要自己调用）</span></span></code></pre><h3 id=\"sub-agent\" tabindex=\"-1\">sub agent</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"bash\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">/agents</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">  管理Agent</span></span></code></pre><h3 id=\"plugin\" tabindex=\"-1\">plugin</h3>\n<p>插件</p>\n","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"控制台","text":"控制台"},{"depth":2,"id":"上下文","text":"上下文"},{"depth":3,"id":"hook","text":"hook"},{"depth":3,"id":"hook-1","text":"hook"},{"depth":3,"id":"skills","text":"skills"},{"depth":3,"id":"sub-agent","text":"sub agent"},{"depth":3,"id":"plugin","text":"plugin"}],"highlighted":{}}}}